Subject: [PATCH 3285/3799] soh: rename D_80AE492C -> sUnusedFreezePos

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same dead copy pattern in EnRd_AttemptPlayerFreeze
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Rd/z_en_rd.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Rd/z_en_rd.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Rd/z_en_rd.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Rd/z_en_rd.c
index 292a1bb28..07580f12d 100644
